OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Brookside star who fled after
OL,4,Afraud trial arrested in Spain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former TV soap actor has been
OL,7,Farrested in Spain after skipping bail
OL,8,Fbefore his trial for a #13.6 million
OL,9,Ffraud that conned would-be models.
OL,11,FPhilip Foster, 51, who played Christian
OL,12,FWright in the Liverpool soap, is wanted
OL,13,Fand must serve an eight-and-a-half year
OL,14,Fjail sentence after being convicted of
OL,15,Ffraud and money laundering last year.
OL,17,FHe ran an operation involving sham
OL,18,Fmodelling agencies that exploited the
OL,19,Fdreams of aspiring young models and
OL,20,Ftheir parents for more than eight
OL,21,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
